# Every text file is LF in the repository and LF in the working tree, on every platform.
# Without this, each machine's `core.autocrlf` decides and mixed endings come back through
# a checkout. `.editorconfig` pins what editors write; this pins what git stores.
* text=auto eol=lf

# The two exceptions. `gradlew` is executed by sh and must stay LF even on Windows;
# `gradlew.bat` is executed by cmd.exe and must stay CRLF.
gradlew text eol=lf
*.bat text eol=crlf

*.jar binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
*.icns binary
*.webp binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary

